# GDHelper Extension — AI Agent Rules

> Read `RULES.md`, `AGENT.md` and `PROJECT_DOCUMENTATION.md` in the project root for the full design system, component standards, and development guidelines before making any changes.

## Quick Reference

### Design: «Aurora Glass»
- Tokens: CSS variables `--gd-*` in `src/index.css`; Tailwind `gd-*`, `accent-*` (indigo, `accent-600` = #4f5bd5) and `slate-*` (cool neutrals) reference them
- Light liquid glass over a soft aurora background on `#root`; Geist / Geist Mono fonts
- Content = glass groups: `.gd-section-title` + `.gd-group` + `.gd-row` / `<ToolRow>`; params as `.gd-chip`; 20px group radius; capsule buttons
- Compact: 40px rows, second line only for errors, rare actions in a "⋯" `.gd-menu`, frequent ones in the command palette
- One accent only; no emerald/teal/gray, no dark backgrounds, no gradients on buttons/cards, no manual borders on groups
- Tailwind **v3** only (no `py-0.2`, `pl-8.5`, `animate-in`); no `/opacity` on var-based colors

### Component Reuse (MANDATORY)
- Text buttons → `<Button>` (`primary` filled, `secondary` gray, `outline` tinted, `ghost` text, `danger`)
- Icon buttons → `<IconButton>` or `.icon-btn` (round); list nav rows → `<ToolRow>`; switch → `.gd-switch`
- Badges → `<Badge>`; fields → `<Input>` / `<Textarea>` / `<Select>` / `.gd-field`; `<SegmentedControl>`
- Modals → `<Modal>` (glass sheet, swipe-to-close); command palette → add commands in `App.tsx` (`PaletteCommand`)

### Motion
- Press scale + icon tap animations are GLOBAL (`src/index.css`, `src/utils/iconTapAnimation.ts`); override with `data-icon-anim`
- Screens: `animate-screen-in/back`; lists: `gd-stagger`; appear: `animate-pop-in`

### Icons
- Components & Navigation: `lucide-react`
- Icons animate on tap automatically (by lucide icon name)

### Types
- All interfaces in `src/types/index.ts` — never duplicate
- Use `React.FC<Props>`, no `any`; `catch` errors → `getErrorMessage()` from `src/utils/errorUtils.ts`

### Language
- UI text: Russian; numerals via `pluralizeRu()` from `src/utils/pluralize.ts`
- Code identifiers: English
- Commits: English (`type: description`)

### Before commit
- Run `npm run build` (must pass with no errors)
- Update `PROJECT_DOCUMENTATION.md` changelog
- Windows PowerShell: use `;` not `&&` to chain commands
